[offset:00:00:50]
[00:01.96]To spend a moment at your beck and call
[00:07.48][01:41.77]Oh, I would give my world to you
[00:12.45][01:46.56]I live my life in simple repetition
[00:17.84]But I would start again if it did you right
[00:22.35]Oh, I spend my days my fists against this wall
[00:28.08]But not a single sound seems to make it through
[00:32.80]Count on my fingers all the grand admissions
[00:38.40]And I can't make it through a single time
[00:41.81][01:55.40][02:19.55][03:34.94]All I wanna do is to do you right
[00:45.44](I wish that I could climb to the greatest heights)
[00:48.63](All the world beneath me when I meet your eye)
[00:52.05][02:29.88][03:52.11]I wish that I could fall a little bit harder
[00:55.84][02:33.28][03:55.54]I wish that I could fall like it would even matter
[00:58.92][02:36.68][03:59.18]I wish that I could fall right into your life
[01:02.00][02:39.88][04:02.18]But I'm not there at all on the other side
[01:05.81][04:05.74]I wish that I could fall and hit the ground running
[01:09.20][04:09.27]I wish that I could fall instead of doing nothing
[01:12.64][04:12.68]I wish that I could fall right between your eyes
[01:15.92]But you just stand so tall I'm left out of sight
[01:19.48]I wish that I could fall somewhere that it won't hurt
[01:23.65][03:39.10][04:33.90]
[01:36.16]Awake uneasy when the morning calls
[01:52.12]But I can barely call what I live a life
[02:00.32]Hold up two fingers, check my double vision
[02:05.91]Beside myself again, beaten black and blue
[02:10.51]Without a purpose, I'm an apparition
[02:16.11]But I could be your sword, you could hold me tight
[02:23.00](I wish that I could fly with these broken wings)
[02:26.47](If it was meant for you, I'd do anything)
[02:43.48]I wish that I could fall and see the sky clearly
[02:47.00]I wish that I could fall not miss the ground completely
[02:50.44]I wish that I could fall somewhere close to you
[02:53.56]But I don't land at all drifting out of view
[02:57.21]I wish that I could fall but only truly backwards
[03:00.63][04:22.84]Right into your arms
[03:04.73][04:26.99]Your arms
[03:08.06](Your arms)
[03:10.65]A fire lit within my chest
[03:13.94]My heart's been burning, wholly dispossessed
[03:17.86](These barely blinking eyes that refuse to cry)
[03:20.83]Oh what I wouldn't give to stay
[03:24.18]To have my joy and sorrow cast away
[03:28.14]But even if my wings have been set alight
[03:31.53]All that I can do is to learn to fly
[04:15.84]But you just stand so tall I'm left out of sight
[04:19.59]I wish that I could fall but only truly backwards 
[04:30.35]Your arms!
